{"ID":"20230716213030-9hq3o01","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230716213030-9hq3o01","name":"EventSystem","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230716213030-9hq3o01\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230716213214-frrqown\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230717163534-rrpodmf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230717163126-lqikm82\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:14,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:14\u0026#125;","title":"UG2L1-2——EventSystem组件","type":"doc","updated":"20251106143202"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230716213214-frrqown","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20230716213214-frrqown","updated":"20251106143202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EventSystem"}]},{"ID":"20230716213212-brg4m5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230716213212-brg4m5g","updated":"20251106143200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要作用是让摄像机渲染出来的物体\n能够接收到 NGUI 的输入事件\n大部分设置不需要我们去修改"}]},{"ID":"20230716213212-kytb4av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230716213212-kytb4av","updated":"20230716213232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有了它我们通过鼠标 触碰 键盘 控制器 操作UI 响应玩家的输入"}]},{"ID":"20230716213233-xtr1mpg","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20230716213233-xtr1mpg","updated":"20251106143202"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173613-z6kfxsb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240321173613-z6kfxsb","updated":"20251106143202"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173613-a8lmbzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321173613-a8lmbzf","updated":"20251106143202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"EventSystem 很重要，如果没有它，我们没有办法监听玩家输入"}]}]},{"ID":"20240321173613-x5xnepe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240321173613-x5xnepe","updated":"20251106143149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173613-u68wd51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321173613-u68wd51","updated":"20251106143149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建 UI 时的 2D UI 和 3D UI 主要就是摄像机的模式不一样\nEventSystem 的 2D 和 3D 主要是 采用 2D 碰撞器 还是 3D 碰撞器 不能直接改变摄像机模式"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251106143041-2ev3kis","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20251106143041-2ev3kis","updated":"20251106143123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20230717163529-as5mr1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230717163529-as5mr1w","updated":"20251106143041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230717163529-kjmcivh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251106142913-ry0c6s8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251106142913-ry0c6s8","updated":"20251106143123"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106142953-f17ie3u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106142953-f17ie3u","updated":"20251106143100"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106143010-ouabt55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106143010-ouabt55","updated":"20251106143010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Event Type  - 事件类型"}]},{"ID":"20251106143010-6jpfupx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106143010-6jpfupx","updated":"20251106143050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"决定了脚本如何对鼠标和触屏事件进行响应：\nUI 模式，那么他们处理事件的方式是根据组件的深度\nWorld 模式，那么则会根据距离离主摄像机的远近来进行响应排序"}]},{"ID":"20251106143010-fbookq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106143010-fbookq0","updated":"20251106143100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2D 和 3D 的区别是，碰撞器是用 3D